    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1">

                <pb facs="0011" n="[1]" sameAs="frus:frus1902app1/pg1"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-03-13"><hi rendition="#italic">March 13,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose copy of a
                    dispatch from Mr. Herbert H. D. Peirce, counsel and agent for the United States
                    in the matter of the whaling and sealing claims against Russia, transmitting a
                    translation into English of the memorandum presenting the claims to the
                    arbitrator.</p>
                <p>The package containing a letter and the translation was forwarded to you under
                    separate cover.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. C. Lodge</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Senate.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
